# Yamaha SEQTRAK Drum tracks for the EUCLID edition of the Polyend Tracker.
# Generated by euclid-synths/tools/seqtrak_from_datalist.py from Yamaha's
# SEQTRAK Data List (Sound List, MIDI Data Format and MIDI Data Table).
# A SEQTRAK track listens on its own MIDI channel (Kick 1 ... Perc 2 7,
# Synth 1 8, Synth 2 9, DX 10): set the Synth page's Device to it.
# Sound sends bank MSB 63, LSB (sound - 1) / 128 and the program; the rest
# are the track's control changes. Settings aren't read back (the SEQTRAK
# has no patch dump), so the page shows what was last sent.
synth "Yamaha SEQTRAK Drum"
hint "Device = the track's channel: Kick 1 .. Perc 2 7"
pause 2
device 1
port din
template cc d+B0 p v
template sound d+B0 00 3F | d+B0 20 vh | d+C0 vl
